{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261027/photo/bkn-20261027104111922-1027_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261027111258\"/><p>路政署路邊工地有水管裂，宛如噴泉。</p><p>筲箕灣有水管爆裂。今晨(27日)10時許，筲箕灣道318號對開西行線的行車路，一個路政署的路邊工地，地底有水管爆裂，大量水湧上路面，猶如湧泉。兩條行車路及行人路被掩浸，現場交通受阻。</p><p>另外，現場樓上一間安老院，懷疑工地施工期間，院舍玻璃窗被震裂，碎片濺傷一名女長者腳部。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:21:34.435400+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:41:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T03:18:48.506150+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:18:48.506150+00:00","content_hash":"20baee3810e36d3624211d4dd014db26c156a543eba64abfe2fb8c9f1ac26315","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}